OPEN_QUESTION DeprecatedGroupIdsOfTheSkeoUpdateAreHandled
	STATUS archived
	ARCHIVED_ON "2026-09-22"
	DESC "what the tool does with a world object or an item whose group id release 2.102"
		+ "deprecated, Phytoplankton2 and Phytoplankton3: keep, flag, convert or drop; As of"
		+ "version 2.102 (September, 2026), Phytoplankton B and C have been removed and replaced"
		+ "with a single variant of phytoplankton. All recipes and generators have been updated to"
		+ "accommodate this change."
		REF @URL.PCFandomWikiPhytoplankton
		REF @DATATABLE.WorldObjectLabels
	RATIONALE "Ruled keep, and no conversion: the owner ruled on 2026-09-22 that the game itself"
		+ "resolves the deprecated ids when it loads a save carrying them, so converting them in"
		+ "the tool would rewrite a save nobody asked to convert. The belief is recorded as a"
		+ "hypothesis with the in-game observation that would refute it, and no table of deprecated"
		+ "ids by release is written"
		REF @DECISION.ADeprecatedGroupIdIsCarriedThroughUnchanged
		REF @HYPOTHESIS.TheGameConvertsDeprecatedPhytoplanktonGroupIdsOnLoad
	SOURCE "PCEdit item catalog: deprecated(\"2.102\", \"Phytoplankton2\", \"Phytoplankton3\"),"
		+ "read on 2026-09-21"
		REF @URL.PceditItemCatalog
		REF @GAME_RELEASE.2.102
